Name: Krypton offline document editor bundle
Short Name: krypton_documents
URL: https://github.com/perpetus/Krypton
Version: 1
License: Multiple; see licenses/*/README.chromium and LICENSE
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Produced outside GN from web_documents/package-lock.json. Individual package
versions, integrity hashes, license hashes and runtime SHA-256 hashes are in
sha256-manifest.json. Third-party code runs only in an untrusted renderer.
Source modifications disable static external service/help/CDN targets; the
final bundler refuses remaining runtime remote origins. All fonts are local.
SVG/XML namespace identifiers are inert and exempt from the origin scan.
